{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0081","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-DATA","construct":"stage_time_identify_bottleneck","difficultyScore":2.2,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"stage_time_identify_bottleneck","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Satu proses mempunyai masa purata: potong 4 minit, gerudi 9 minit, kemas 5 minit dan bungkus 3 minit bagi setiap unit. Jika semua stesen bekerja satu unit pada satu masa, stesen mana paling mungkin menjadi penghalang aliran?","options":["Stesen potong","Stesen kemas","Stesen gerudi","Stesen bungkus"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Stesen paling lambat mengambil masa 9 minit setiap unit.","Ia mengehadkan kadar keluaran keseluruhan jika kapasiti stesen lain lebih cepat."],"patternSignature":"ps-b002-0081-stage_time_identify_bottleneck","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0082","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-DATA","construct":"compare_success_rate_different_sample_sizes","difficultyScore":2.3,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"compare_success_rate_different_sample_sizes","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Kaedah P berjaya 42 daripada 50 percubaan. Kaedah Q berjaya 72 daripada 90 percubaan. Berdasarkan kadar kejayaan, kaedah mana lebih tinggi?","options":["Kaedah Q, 80%","Kaedah Q, 72%","Kedua-duanya 84%","Kaedah P, 84%"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["P=42/50=84%.","Q=72/90=80%, jadi P mempunyai kadar lebih tinggi."],"patternSignature":"ps-b002-0082-compare_success_rate_different_sample_sizes","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0083","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-DATA","construct":"inventory_reconcile_expected_vs_actual","difficultyScore":2.0,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"inventory_reconcile_expected_vs_actual","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Rekod stor menunjukkan 120 unit pada awal hari. Sebanyak 35 unit dikeluarkan dan 20 unit diterima. Kiraan fizikal akhir hari ialah 102 unit. Berapakah perbezaan berbanding stok yang sepatutnya?","options":["3 unit kurang","3 unit lebih","17 unit kurang","5 unit kurang"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Stok sepatutnya=120−35+20=105 unit.","Kiraan fizikal 102, jadi kurang 3 unit."],"patternSignature":"ps-b002-0083-inventory_reconcile_expected_vs_actual","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0084","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-DATA","construct":"choose_chart_metric_for_wait_time_improvement","difficultyScore":1.7,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"choose_chart_metric_for_wait_time_improvement","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Sebuah kaunter mahu menilai sama ada perubahan proses mengurangkan masa menunggu. Data yang paling berguna untuk dibandingkan sebelum dan selepas perubahan ialah?","options":["Warna pakaian pelanggan","Purata atau median masa menunggu pelanggan","Bilangan kerusi di pejabat lain","Nama petugas mengikut abjad"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Matlamatnya ialah mengukur perubahan pada masa menunggu.","Ukuran masa menunggu sebelum dan selepas secara langsung menjawab soalan itu."],"patternSignature":"ps-b002-0084-choose_chart_metric_for_wait_time_improvement","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0085","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-DATA","construct":"three_day_consumption_simple_forecast","difficultyScore":1.8,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"three_day_consumption_simple_forecast","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Penggunaan bahan tiga hari berturut-turut ialah 18, 20 dan 19 unit, tanpa perubahan operasi dijangka. Jika mahu anggaran kasar untuk hari berikutnya berdasarkan purata tiga hari, berapa unit?","options":["18 unit","20 unit","19 unit","57 unit"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Purata=(18+20+19)÷3=57÷3.","Anggaran kasar berdasarkan purata ialah 19 unit."],"patternSignature":"ps-b002-0085-three_day_consumption_simple_forecast","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0086","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-ALLOCATION","construct":"time_allocation_ratio_two_tasks","difficultyScore":1.8,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"time_allocation_ratio_two_tasks","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Masa latihan 100 minit dibahagi antara latihan teori dan amali mengikut nisbah 2:3. Berapa minit untuk amali?","options":["40 minit","50 minit","75 minit","60 minit"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah bahagian=2+3=5, setiap bahagian=100÷5=20 minit.","Amali mendapat 3×20=60 minit."],"patternSignature":"ps-b002-0086-time_allocation_ratio_two_tasks","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0087","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-ALLOCATION","construct":"staff_assignment_skill_constraint","difficultyScore":2.3,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"staff_assignment_skill_constraint","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Terdapat tiga tugasan: elektrik, rekod dan penghantaran. Amir sahaja mempunyai kelayakan elektrik; Bella dan Chen boleh mengurus rekod; Chen sahaja mempunyai lesen memandu. Jika setiap orang perlu mendapat satu tugas, agihan manakah sah?","options":["Amir-elektrik, Bella-rekod, Chen-penghantaran","Amir-rekod, Bella-elektrik, Chen-penghantaran","Amir-elektrik, Bella-penghantaran, Chen-rekod","Amir-penghantaran, Bella-rekod, Chen-elektrik"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Tugas elektrik mesti diberi kepada Amir, dan penghantaran mesti diberi kepada Chen.","Baki tugas rekod diberi kepada Bella."],"patternSignature":"ps-b002-0087-staff_assignment_skill_constraint","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0088","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-ALLOCATION","construct":"pallet_box_capacity_minimum","difficultyScore":1.7,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"pallet_box_capacity_minimum","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Satu palet boleh memuatkan maksimum 16 kotak. Sebanyak 70 kotak perlu disusun dan setiap kotak mesti berada di atas palet. Berapa palet minimum diperlukan?","options":["4 palet","5 palet","6 palet","7 palet"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["4 palet hanya memuatkan 64 kotak.","5 palet menyediakan kapasiti 80 kotak, jadi minimum 5."],"patternSignature":"ps-b002-0088-pallet_box_capacity_minimum","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0089","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-ALLOCATION","construct":"equal_ration_after_emergency_reserve","difficultyScore":1.9,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"equal_ration_after_emergency_reserve","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Terdapat 140 L air. Sebanyak 20 L mesti disimpan sebagai simpanan kecemasan. Baki hendak dibahagi sama kepada 6 kumpulan. Berapa liter setiap kumpulan?","options":["18 L","22 L","20 L","24 L"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Baki untuk diagih=140−20=120 L.","120÷6=20 L setiap kumpulan."],"patternSignature":"ps-b002-0089-equal_ration_after_emergency_reserve","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
{"bankId":"B-PS-NEW-0090","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Penyelesaian Masalah","format":"MCQ","repeatFamily":"PS-ALLOCATION","construct":"budget_reserve_then_equal_projects","difficultyScore":1.8,"cognitiveDemand":"practical_problem_solving","reasoningForm":"budget_reserve_then_equal_projects","presentationForm":"real_world_scenario","recommendedMinSetGap":8,"setAssignment":null,"question":"Bajet RM1,000 perlu menyimpan RM160 sebagai dana kecemasan. Baki dibahagi sama kepada 4 projek. Berapa peruntukan setiap projek?","options":["RM200","RM240","RM260","RM210"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Baki=RM1,000−RM160=RM840.","RM840÷4=RM210 setiap projek."],"patternSignature":"ps-b002-0090-budget_reserve_then_equal_projects","reviewStatus":"AUTHORED_PENDING_QA"}
